{"id":"n66836-1-3","stage":5,"title":"아무쪼록 · 千万","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66836-1-3-1","ko":"남부 지방에 태풍이 와서 피해가 크대.","zh":"南部地区来了台风，据说损失很严重。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"남부","meaning":"南部","explanation":"남부：南部。","readings":[{"term":"남부","audio":"/audio/73ddd362632dd7846eb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28399","senseId":"1","lemma":"남부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남부","audio":"/audio/73ddd362632dd7846eb9.mp3"}},{"text":"지방에","meaning":"地区","explanation":"지방：地区；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지방","audio":"/audio/aa8a6ab7ce21201d9d47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71323","senseId":"1","lemma":"지방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지방에","audio":"/audio/5dcb93a141bf71839f79.mp3"}},{"text":"태풍이","meaning":"台风","explanation":"태풍：台风；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"태풍","audio":"/audio/1d1d0a3fd2bb06745f7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72181","senseId":"1","lemma":"태풍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"태풍이","audio":"/audio/e1d7344bb04b76817759.mp3"}},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来自，起因于","explanation":"오다：来自，起因于；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"20","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"피해가","meaning":"被害，受害，遇害","explanation":"피해：被害，受害，遇害；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"피해","audio":"/audio/eeb61bc5c7fb3a10dc0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85548","senseId":"1","lemma":"피해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피해가","audio":"/audio/d51e2b15df68aa5eb2da.mp3"}},{"text":"크대.","meaning":"重，重大，严重","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크대","audio":"/audio/80a08c6ae58e131359c4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"73ddd362632dd784","term":"남부","zh":"南部","audio":"/audio/73ddd362632dd7846eb9.mp3","entryId":"28399","definition":"某个地区的南边。","pronunciation":["남부"]},{"id":"aa8a6ab7ce21201d","term":"지방","zh":"地区","audio":"/audio/aa8a6ab7ce21201d9d47.mp3","entryId":"71323","definition":"根据行政划分或某种特征而划分的区域。","pronunciation":["지방"]},{"id":"1d1d0a3fd2bb0674","term":"태풍","zh":"台风","audio":"/audio/1d1d0a3fd2bb06745f7b.mp3","entryId":"72181","definition":"主要指在7~9月，从太平洋刮到韩国、日本等亚洲大陆东部地区的伴随暴雨的狂风。","pronunciation":["태풍"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来自，起因于","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"因为某个原因而产生。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"eeb61bc5c7fb3a10","term":"피해","zh":"被害，受害，遇害","audio":"/audio/eeb61bc5c7fb3a10dc0b.mp3","entryId":"85548","definition":"生命、身体、财产或名誉等受到损害；或指那样的损害。","pronunciation":["피ː해"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"重，重大，严重","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"某事的规模、范围、程度、力量等都超过了一般水平。","pronunciation":["크다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b815a517ad1b471a9025.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66836-1-3-2","ko":"아무쪼록 사람들은 다치지 않았으면 좋겠다.","zh":"希望大家都不要受伤。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아무쪼록","meaning":"千万","explanation":"아무쪼록：千万。","readings":[{"term":"아무쪼록","audio":"/audio/2be7287dd1b1ddfc2fd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66836","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무쪼록","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무쪼록","audio":"/audio/2be7287dd1b1ddfc2fd3.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들은","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들은","audio":"/audio/f7f40c6478ace61ef47f.mp3"}},{"text":"다치지","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다치지","audio":"/audio/2a19c8626204513e27bc.mp3"}},{"text":"않았으면","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않았으면","audio":"/audio/1ae547ca40ea325e1049.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠다.","meaning":"那样就好了","explanation":"좋다：那样就好了；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"18","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠다","audio":"/audio/662bbd805e871b1915e9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2be7287dd1b1ddfc","term":"아무쪼록","zh":"千万","audio":"/audio/2be7287dd1b1ddfc2fd3.mp3","entryId":"66836","definition":"尽量。","pronunciation":["아ː무쪼록"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"那样就好了","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"否定前面的同时进行指责。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/af3ac84266800bc392c9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.216,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWo